2 CONT *3.         daughter (before [1201/02]-). ... '''m''' ALEXANDER of Bulgaria, sébastokrator, son of IVAN ASEN I Tsar of the Bulgarians & his [first/second] wife --- (-before 1241).  
2 CONT
