2 CONT *5.         STEFAN VLADISLAV (-11 Nov after 1267 [1269]).  ... '''m''' ([1233]) BELISAVA Asenina of Bulgaria, daughter of IVAN ASEN II Tsar of the Bulgarians & his first wife Anna --- (before 1221-after 1285).  ...  
2 CONT
