2 CONT **c)         daughter .  Her parentage is confirmed by the charter dated to [1240/72] under which “Georgius comes, regis Vladislavi gener” made peace with Ragusa[165].  '''m''' DJURE Kačić Knez of Omiš.  “Georgius comes, regis Vla
2 CONC dislavi gener” made peace with Ragusa by charter dated to [1240/72][166].  1239/74.  
