2 CONC gari" as the four children of "Theodori…Comnenangeli"[45].  The life of St Sava by Domentijan records that "Radoslav son cousin" (referring to Saint Saba) married "l´empereur grec…Théodore Lascaris…la fille"[46].  The primary sour
2 CONC ce which confirms her correct parentage at the time of her marriage has not yet been identified.  Her marriage was arranged by her father as part of peace terms with Serbia[47].  Her influence over her husband triggered the 1233 r
2 CONC ebellion which led to his deposition[48].  She became a nun in Serbia.  
2 CONT
