2 CONT Anna Komnene, who married the Caesar Nicephorus Bryennius. Maria Komnene, who married (1) Gregory Gabras and (2) Nicephorus Euphorbenos Katakalon. John II Komnenos, who succeeded as emperor. Andronikos Comnenus, sebastokratōr. Isa
