1 NOTE With the help of the army and his numerous relatives, Alexius I Comnenus usurped the throne of the Byzantine Empire from Nicephorus III in 1081.  Alexius ruled until 1118.  He was succeeded by his son John II.
1 NOTE Alexio_I Comonus coin
