2 CONC Byzantium: The Decline and Fall, 74 ^ J. Norwich, Byzantium: The Decline and Fall, 82 ^ J. Norwich, Byzantium: The Decline and Fall, 76 ^ J. Harris, Byzantium and The Crusades, 86 ^ Choniates p.22 Sources
