2 CONC Serbia 1202–1204. Jefimija - married Manuel Angelus Ducas Regent of Thesaloniki (+1241)[2]. unknown daughter - married an unknown member of the Asen family, gave birth to the Bulgarian Tsar Constantine Tih Asen (reigned 1257–1277)
