2 CONT Andronikos II and Michael IX Palaeologus (Silver basilikon).
2 CONT
2 CONT In spite of the resolution of problems in Europe, Andronikos II was faced with the collapse of the Byzantine frontier in Asia Minor. After the failure of the co-emperor Michael IX to stem the Turkish advance in Asia Minor in 1300,
