2 CONC s (in 1252) “filiam de Kunring de Austria” as mistress of “Przemysl filius regis Wenceslai” and mother of “filium...Nicolauum...postea...ducem Opaviensem” and of “postea tres filias” who married “unam...domino de Strakonicz, secun
2 CONC dam de Wartemberg et de Druholz, tertiam...Vockoni de Krawau”[340].  m [BAVOR] [III] Herr von Strakonicz, son of ---. 
