2 CONT '''Brigitte Jutta von Sachsen''', Markgräfin von Brandenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT Birgitte's exact date of birth is unknown but it is believed that she was born around 1228 to [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-von-Sachsen/6000000001651629109 Albrecht I, Herzog von Sachsen] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Agn
2 CONC es-von-%C3%96sterreich/6000000009465627532 Agnes, Prinzessin von Österreich].
2 CONT
2 CONT * From the German [http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johann_I._%28Brandenburg%29 Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with [http://www.geni.com/people/Johann-I-von-Brandenburg/6000000000865518088 Johann I, Markgraf von Brandenburg]: 
2 CONT
2 CONT - [http://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-von-Brandenburg/4103327 Agnes] (ca. 1255 - 1304), married 1st since 1273 with [http://www.geni.com/people/Erik-V-Kipping-Konge-af-Danmark/5304611081740076756 Eric V, King  of Denmark] "Klipping"
2 CONC  (1249 - 1286), married 2nd since 1293 with [http://www.geni.com/people/Gerhard-II-von-Holstein-Pl%C3%B6n/6000000003897519492 Gerhard II  Graf von Holstein-Plön] (1254 - 1312), marriage from ca. 1290-1312.
2 CONT
2 CONT - [http://www.geni.com/people/Heinrich-I-markgraf-von-Brandenburg/6000000001504958369 Heinrich I] "Lackland", Margrave of Landsberg (1256 - 1318)
2 CONT
2 CONT - [http://www.geni.com/people/Mechthild-von-Brandenburg/6000000008020738278 Mechthild] (b.? - died before 1209), married to Bogislaw IV, Duke of Pomerania (1258-1309)
2 CONT
2 CONT - [http://www.geni.com/people/Albrecht-von-Brandenburg/6000000008062590885 Albrecht] (ca. 1258 - 1290)
2 CONT
2 CONT - [http://www.geni.com/people/Hermann-von-Brandenburg/6000000010936907187 Hermann] (b.?- 1290) Clergyman, died of natural causes at the convent of Havelberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I13150&tree=2 finnholbek.dk - Jutta von Sachsen]
