2 CONC tin, with the consent of "Marie me dame et me mère", by charter dated Mar 1276[914].  "Marie de Kaieu jadis fame monseigneur Ansel de Kaieu, grant baron et camberlenc de l ‘empiere de Costantinoble, et Anseaus, leur fils" donated 
2 CONC property to the monks of Dommartin by charter dated Jun 1277[915].  "Anssiaus de Cayeu chevaliers sires de Dominois" donated property to the abbey of Valoires, with the consent of "me dame Maroie me femme", by charter dated Apr 12
2 CONC 83[916].  "Messire Ansiaux de Caïeu" acknowledged that he had no rights over "le terrois de Houssoy" by charter dated Nov 1288[917].  
2 CONT
