1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Emperor of Nicaea from August 18, 1258 to 1259. A military revolution placed Michael VIII, Palaeologus (1259-82), at the head of the State, in place of the child John IV, Lascaris (1258-59). 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
