2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT John Doukas or Ducas (Greek: Ιωάννης Δούκας, Iōannēs Doukas), (died c. 1088), was the son of Andronikos Doukas, a Paphlagonian nobleman who may have served as governor of the theme of Moesia and younger brother of Emperor Constant
2 CONC ine X Doukas.
