2 CONT 1.         GEORGIOS Komnenodoukas Palaiologos ([1125]-[1167/68]).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not been identified.  Grand Heteriarch.  A seal dated to [1158] names "Georgios Palaiologos, from the root of a
2 CONC  Komnenos"[20].  The record of the synod of 2 Mar 1166 records the presence of “...sebasto et magno hetæreiarcha domino Georgio Palæologo...”[21].  A seal dated to [1175] names "Georgios Palaiologos, who proudly claims birth in th
2 CONC e family of the Komneno-Doukai"[22].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---.  The name of Georgios's wife is not known.  
2 CONT
2 CONT      Georgios & his wife had three or more children: 
