1 NOTE Vukan II Nemanjic was king of the Zeta (1196-1208) and Grand Župan of Serbia (1202-1204).
2 CONT He had three sons: Ðorde, Stefan, and Dmitri. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kostadin, father of Vasoje, the founder of the Vasojevic family, was probably the son of Vukan, according to some historian, but was more probably his grandson from his (Vukan's) son, Stefan.
