2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BYZANTINE%20NOBILITY.htm#AnnaPhilanthropenaMManuelIIITreb
2 CONT
2 CONT ii)         ANNA Philanthropena Kyra .  The Chronicle of Michael Panaretos records that "the emperor Manuel who was a widower" married "Philanthropenos´s daughter the Lady Anna" after she was brought back from Constantinople by hi
2 CONC s sister "the empress lady Eudokia"[554].  Ruy Gonzalez de Clavijo records that "the emperor of Trebizond…Germanoli" was married to "a relation of the Emperor of Constantinople", in 1404[555].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (after 14 Sep 1395) as his second wife, MANUEL III Emperor in Trebizond, son of ALEXIOS III Emperor in Trebizond & his wife Theodora Kantakouzene (16 Dec 1363-5 Mar 1412, bur Theoskepastos). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # Williams, Kelsey Jackson.  ''A Genealogy of the Grand Komnenoi of Trebizond'' (1/2007) < [https://research-repository.st-andrews.ac.uk/handle/10023/8570 link] > 
