2 CONT
2 CONT ===King of Bohemia 1278–1305===
2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Premysl-Otakar/6000000000717531158 Ottokar II] '''Successor:''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Wenceslaus-III-of-Bohemia/6000000001500929136 Wenceslaus III]
