1 NOTE {geni:about_me}      Otton Herzog von Österreich was born in 1301.1 He was the son of Albrecht I von Habsburg, Holy Roman Emperor and Elisabeth von Kärnten.1 He married, firstly, Elisabeth von Wittelsbach, daughter of Stefan I Her
2 CONC zog von Niederbayern, in 1325.1 He married, secondly, Anna de Luxembourg, daughter of Jean de Luxembourg, King of Bohemia, in 1335. He died in 1339.1
2 CONT      He was a member of the House of Habsburg.2 He succeeded to the title of Herzog von Österreich in 1330.2 Children of Otton Herzog von Österreich and Elisabeth von Wittelsbach
2 CONT
