2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Wladislaw I, King of Poland (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #114172, b. 1260, d. 1333
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=30 Jul 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wladislaw I, King of Poland was born in 1260. (3) He was the son of Casimir I, Duke of Kuiavia and Euphrosina of Opole. (2) He married Hedwig Piast, daughter of Boleslaw, Duke of Kalisz and Helen Arpád, in 1293. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1333. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wladislaw I, King of Poland was a member of the House of Piast. (4) He was a member of the House of Wladislaw 'the Short' (?). (4) He succeeded to the title of Duke of Cracow in 1306. (2) He was created King Wladislaw I of Po
2 CONC land in 1320. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Wladislaw I, King of Poland and Hedwig Piast
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Kunigarde of Poland+ d. 13312
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Elisabeth of Poland+ b. c 1305, d. 13821
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Casimir III, King of Poland+ b. 30 Apr 1310, d. 5 Nov 1370 (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás - Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p11418.htm#i114172
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://hu.wikipedia.org/wiki/I._Ulászló_lengyel_király
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------
