2 CONT Chapter 2.    ANEMAS
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.         KONSTANTINOS Anemas (-after [1000]).  A seal dated to [1100] names "Konstantinos Anemas spatharios and episkeptites of Armeniakon"[46]. 
