2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT ***C3. '''THEODOROS I Komnenos Dukas Angelos, Emp of Thessalonica, +in prison in Nicaea shortly after 1253'''; m.before 1210 Maria Dukaina Komnene Petraliphaina
2 CONT ****D1. Ioannes Komnenos, Emp of Thessalonica, +1244
2 CONT ****D2. Demetrios Komnenos Dukas, despot of Thessalonica, *1225, +ca 1246
2 CONT ****D3. Anna Dukaina, +in Serbia 1258; m.1219/20 Stefan Dukas Radoslav, King of Serbia (+after 1235)
2 CONT ****D4. Eirene Komnene; m.1237/38 Tsar Ivan Asen II of the Bulgarians (+1241)
2 CONT *** ...
