2 CONT '''Irene of Brunswick''', born '''Adelheid''', (Greek: Ειρήνη; c. 1293 – 16/17 August 1324) was the first wife of Andronikos III Palaiologos,[1] and by marriage Byzantine empress, although she died before her husband became senior
2 CONC  emperor.
