2 CONT -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CARINTHIA.htm#HeinrichIIGorzdied1323
2 CONT
2 CONT b) '''JOHANN HEINRICH''' (-Trieste 17 Mar 1338). He succeeded his father in 1323 as JOHANN HEINRICH Graf von Görz. Reichsvicar of Treviso until 1329. The necrology of Minoritenkirche, Vienna records the death "XVI Kal Mar" of "Ioh
2 CONC annes com Goritie"[1030]. The necrology of Seligenthal records the death "XVI Kal Apr" of "dominus Iohannes com de Görtze, filius domine Beatricis nobilis ducisse Bawarie"[1031]. m (29 Sep 1336) as her second husband, ANNA of Aust
2 CONC ria, widow of HEINRICH III "der Natternberger" Duke of Bavaria in Niederbayern, daughter of FRIEDRICH I "dem Schönen" Duke of Austria & his wife Infanta doña Isabel de Aragón (1318-Vienna 14 Dec 1343, bur Vienna St Klara). The pri
2 CONC mary source which confirms her first marriage has not so far been identified. Nun at Convent of St Klara Vienna 1340, later Abbess. The Necrologium Austriacum records the death "1343 XIX Kal Ian" of "Anna filia Friderici regis Rom
2 CONC anorum coma de Goertz", specifying that she entered "ordinem S Clare in Wienna" after the death of her husband, and her burial there[1032].
