2 CONC s II Phocas. 11.[S261] Regnal Chronologies, online http://www.hostkingdom.net/regindex.html 12.[S862] Various EB CD 2001, John I Tzimisces (Byz. emp.). 13.[S25] J. M. Hussey, Cambridge Medieval History, Vol 4, Part 1, pg. 792.
