2 CONT *A1. Konstantinos X Dukas, Emperor of Byzantium (1059-67), +1067; 1m: a dau.of Konstantinos Dalassenos; 2m: before 1050 Eudokia Makrembolitissa (+1096)
2 CONT **B1. Michael VII Dukas "Parapinaces", Emp of Byzantium (1071-78), then became a monk and then Metropolitan of Ephesus, +1090; m.after 1071 Maria of Georgia(+after 1090)
2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT **B2. a son, +shortly after 24.11.1059
2 CONT **B3. '''Andronikos Dukas, co-emperor of Byzantium (1071-81), *1057, +after 1081'''; m.1068 Maria of Hungary
2 CONT **B4. Konstantinos Porphyrogennetos Dukas, co-emperor (1067-78), *1060, +1081
2 CONT **B5. Anna Dukaina, a nun, *before 1057, +after 1075
2 CONT **B6. Theodora Dukaina, *before 1059, +after 1075; m.after 1071 Domenico Silvio, Doge of Venice
2 CONT **B7. Zoe Dukaine, *1062, +ca 1136
