2 CONC , Norway .)
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes married Havtore Jonsson Roos Til Sudreim, son of Jon Raud Ivarsson Roos Til Sudreim and Ukjent, in 1302. (Havtore Jonsson Roos Til Sudreim was born around 1275 and died in 1320 in Sørum (Sudreim, Skedjuhof)), Sørum, Akershus
2 CONC  , Norway.)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes was the illegitimate daughter of Håkan V Magnusson, the last of the Sverreätten and her sons had inheritance rights to the Norwegian throne. She was married to Councilor Hafthor Jo
