1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonardo_I_Tocco
2 CONT
2 CONT Cefalónia bárója ( Conte di Cefalonia i Itaca-Zante-Leucade-Vonizza)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LATIN%20LORDSHIPS%20IN%20GREECE.htm#LeonardoToccoZantediedafter1374B
2 CONT
2 CONT '''LEONARDO Tocco''', son of GUGLIELMO Tocco Governor of Corfu & his [second] wife Margherita Orsini of Kefalonia (-[20 Mar 1375/25 Aug 1377]).  He negotiated to secure the liberation of Robert Principe di Tarento [Anjou-Capet] ti
2 CONC tular Emperor of Constantinople and Prince of Achaia from imprisonment in Hungary in 1352[639].  He was invested as '''Count of Kefalonia''' by Robert in 1357.  Lord of Ithaca and Zante.  He conquered the island of Santa Mavra and
2 CONC  the fort of Vonitza in 1362.  He was among the envoys who went to Naples in 1374 to offer the principality of Achaia to Jeanne I Queen of Naples following the death of Philippe di Tarento [Anjou-Capet] in 1373[640].  m (before au
2 CONC tumn 1361) MADDALENA Buondelmonti, daughter of MANENTE Buondelmonti & his wife Lapa Acciaiuoli (-after 11 Mar 1401).  Count Leonardo & his wife had five children:  
2 CONT *1.         PETRONILLA Tocco (-[22 Jun 1409/27 Sep 1410]). ... m firstly ([1372]) NICOLÒ dalle Carceri Lord of Eubœa Duke of Naxos and the Archipelago, son of GIOVANNI dalle Carceri Lord of Eubœa & his wife Fiorenza Sanudo Dss of 
2 CONC Naxos and the Archipelago (-murdered Naxos 1383).  m secondly ([1383]) as his first wife, NICOLA Vernier, son of --- Doge of Venice & his wife --- (-before 30 Sep 1422).  
2 CONT *2.         GIOVANNA Tocco .  m ENRICO di Ventimiglia Conte di Gorace (-[1413]).  
2 CONT *4.         CARLO Tocco ([1374/75]-Janina 4 Jul 1429, bur Zante, Franciscan monastery[641]). ... m (1388) FRANCESCA Acciaiuoli, daughter of NERIO Acciaiuoli Duke of Athens & his wife Agnese Saraceno . ... Count Carlo had seven ill
2 CONC egitimate children by unknown mistresses: 
2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT *5.         LEONARDO Tocco ([1375/76]-[1418/19]). ...
2 CONT ** ...
