2 CONC led by "domini Alexandri ducis Lithwanie et domini Kernoviensis"[120].  m (before 25 Jan 1390) HEDWIG von Oppeln, daughter of WLADISLAW Duke of Oppeln, Palatine of Hungary [Piast] & his second wife Euphemia of Mazovia [Piast] ([13
