2 CONT *'''Margareta of Holland1,2,3,4,5,6,7
2 CONT *'''F, #18635, b. 24 June 1310, d. 23 June 1356
2 CONT *Father	Guillaume III 'the Good', Count of Holland, Zeeland, and Hainault, Lord of Friesland3,4,5,8,9 b. c 1286, d. 8 Jun 1337
2 CONT *Mother	Jeanne de Valois3,5,8,9 b. c 1294, d. 7 Mar 1352
2 CONT *'''     Margareta of Holland was born on 24 June 1310 at of Le Quesnoy, Nord, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.5 She married Ludwig IV, Duke of Bavaria, Holy Roman Emperor, King of Italy & Germany''', son of Ludwig II, Duke of Bavaria,
2 CONC  Count & Elector Palatine and Mathilda von Habsburg, '''on 25 February 1324 at Cologne, North Rhine-Westphalia, Germany; They had 5 sons''' (Ludwig; Guillaume V, Duke of Bavaria, Count of Hainaut, Holland, & Zeeland; Albrecht, Cou
2 CONC nt of Hainaut, Holland, & Zeeland; Otto; & Ludwig) '''and 5 daughters''' (Margaretha, wife of Stephan of Anjou, Duke of Croatia, Dalmatia, & Salvonia, & of Gerlach, Count of Hohenlohe; Anna; Elisabeth, wife on Cangrande II della S
2 CONC cala, Lord of Verona, & of Ulrich, Count of Württemberg; Anna; & Beatrix, wife of Eric XII, King of Sweden).3,4,5,6,7 '''Margareta of Holland died on 23 June 1356 at Le Quesnoy, Nord, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France, at age 45; Buried 
2 CONC at Valenciennes.5,6,7
2 CONT *'''Family     Ludwig IV, Duke of Bavaria, Holy Roman Emperor, King of Italy & Germany''' b. 1 Apr 1282, d. 11 Oct 1347
2 CONT *Children	
2 CONT **Margarethe of Bavaria+2 b. 1325, d. 1374
2 CONT **Anna of Bavaria2 b. c 1326, d. 3 Jun 1361
2 CONT **Ludwig VI 'the Roman', Elector of Brandenburg, Duke of Upper Bavaria2 b. 7 May 1328, d. 17 May 1375
2 CONT **Elisabeth of Bavaria+ b. 1329, d. 2 Aug 1402
2 CONT **Sir Wilhelm (V) I, Duke of Bavaria, Graf von Holland, Hainault, Zeeland, Lord of Friesland+2,10,4,6,7 b. 12 May 1330, d. 15 Apr 1388
2 CONT **Albrecht I, Duke of Bavaria, Count Holand & Hainault+ b. 25 Jul 1336, d. 13 Dec 1404
2 CONT **Otto V, Duke of Bavaria, Markgraf von Brandenburg2 b. 1340 or 1342, d. 15 Nov 1379
2 CONT **Beatrix of Bavaria2 b. 1344, d. 25 Dec 1359
2 CONT **Agnes of Bavaria11 b. 1345, d. 11 Nov 1352
2 CONT **Ludwig of Bavaria11 b. c 1 Oct 1347, d. 1348
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S5637] Unknown author, Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Gerald Paget, Vol. II, p. 384; Europaische Stammtafeln by Isenburg, chart 24, Vol. 1.
2 CONT *[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. I, Tafel 24.
2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 655.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 532.
2 CONT *[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVIII, Tafel 49.
2 CONT *[S6] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry: 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 391-392.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 190.
2 CONT *[S6] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry: 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 391.
2 CONT *[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. III, p. 189.
2 CONT *[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 426-427.
2 CONT *[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. I/1, Tafel 104.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p620.htm#i18635 ______________________
2 CONT *'''Marguerite III d'Avesnes, Comtesse de Hainaut et Gravin van Holland en Zeeland1
2 CONT *'''F, #1991, b. 1311, d. circa 1356
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 Oct 2013
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.47%
2 CONT *'''     Marguerite III d'Avesnes, Comtesse de Hainaut et Gravin van Holland en Zeeland was born in 1311. She was the daughter''' of Guillaume V (III) d'Avesnes, Comte de Hainaut et Graaf van Holland en Zeeland and Jeanne de Valoi
2 CONC s.1 '''She married Ludwig IV von Bayern, Holy Roman Emperor''', son of Ludwig II Herzog von Oberbayern and Mathilde von Habsburg, '''on 25 February 1324 at Cologne, Germany.2 She died circa 1356.
2 CONT *'''     She succeeded to the title of Gravin van Holland en Zeeland in 1345.1 She succeeded to the title of Comtesse de Hainaut in 1345.1 She abdicated as Countess of Holland in 1354.1
2 CONT *'''Children of Marguerite III d'Avesnes, Comtesse de Hainaut et Gravin van Holland en Zeeland and Ludwig IV von Bayern, Holy Roman Emperor
2 CONT **Wilhelm III Herzog von Bayern-Straubing Comte de Hainaut et Graaf van Holland en Zeeland1 b. 12 May 1330, d. 15 Apr 1389
2 CONT **Albrecht I Herzog von Bayern-Straubing Comte de Hainaut et Graaf van Holland en Zeeland+ b. 25 Jul 1336, d. 12 Dec 1404
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *[S38] John Morby, Dynasties of the World: a chronological and genealogical handbook (Oxford, Oxfordshire, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1989), page 91. Hereinafter cited as Dynasties of the World.
2 CONT *[S3268] Hans Harmsen, "re: Chester Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 21 August 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Chester Family."
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p200.htm#i1991 ____________________
2 CONT *'''Margarete II de Avesnes
2 CONT *'''Birth: 	1311
2 CONT *'''Death: 	Jun. 23, 1356
2 CONT *Royalty. '''Countess of Avesnes and Hainaut, German Queen and Roman Empress'''. Born the daugther of Guillaume III and Jeanne de Valois '''she married Ludwig in 1324 and bore him ten children. 
