1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://fabpedigree.com/s091/f094135.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT The PEDIGREE of
2 CONT Catherine d' AVESNES
2 CONT      Born:  abt. 1320    Died:  aft. 1375
2 CONT
2 CONT  Husband/Partner:       Paon (Sir; of GUIENNE) de ROET
2 CONT  Possible Child:       Katherine ROELT
2 CONT  Alternative Mother of Possible Child:       prob. another of AVESNES family
2 CONT _______________________________________________-
2 CONT
2 CONT https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p5212.htm#i156491
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine d' Avesnes1
2 CONT Last Edited	4 Apr 2020
2 CONT F, #156491, b. circa 1320, d. 1380
2 CONT Father	Guillaume III 'the Good', Count of Holland, Zeeland, and Hainault, Lord of Friesland1 b. c 1286, d. 8 Jun 1337
2 CONT Mother	Jeanne de Valois1 b. c 1294, d. 7 Mar 1352
2 CONT Charts	Pedigree of James Irvine
2 CONT      Catherine d' Avesnes was born circa 1320 at of Henegouwen, Wallonia, Belgium.1 She married Sir Payn Roet, Heer van Roet, son of Payen van Roet, Heer van Roet, circa 1339.1 Catherine d' Avesnes died in 1380 at Ghent, Flanders,
2 CONC  Belgium.1
2 CONT Family
2 CONT Sir Payn Roet, Heer van Roet b. c 1305, d. 1380
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT Katherine Roet+1 b. 25 Nov 1340, d. 10 May 1403
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT [S11640] Www.genealogieonline.nl.
2 CONT _______________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p68850.htm#i688494
2 CONT
2 CONT Catherine d'Avesnes1
2 CONT F, #688494
2 CONT Last Edited=20 Sep 2016
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.49%
2 CONT      Catherine d'Avesnes is the daughter of Guillaume V (III) d'Avesnes, Comte de Hainaut et Graaf van Holland en Zeeland and Jeanne de Valois.1 She married Sir Payne Roët, son of Payne de Roët.1
2 CONT      Her married name became Roët.1
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT [S1916] Tim Boyle, "re: Boyle Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 16 September 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Boyle Family."
2 CONT Payne de Roët1 
2 CONT _________________________________________________
