2 CONT Louis I of Châtillon (d. August 26, 1346, battle of Crécy), son of Guy I of Blois-Châtillon and Marguerite of Valois, was count of Blois and lord of Avesnes 1342–1346.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1340 in Soissons, he married Jeanne of Avesnes, Countess of Soissons (d. 1350), daughter of John of Avesnes, Lord of Beaumont. They had three children:
