1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bianca_d%27Aragona
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SICILY.htm#Biancadied1372
2 CONT
2 CONT 9.         BLANCA of Sicily ([1342]-[1372]).  Zurita names “doña Eufemia, doña Blanca y doña Violante” as the three youngest of the four daughters of “el rey don Pedro de la reyna doña Isabel su muger”[775].  Zurita records that “
2 CONC el Rey [de Aragon]...la Infanta doña Juana su hija” married “don Juan Conde de Ampurias hijo del Infante don Ramon Berenguer” after the death of his first wife “la Infanta doña Blanca hermana del Rey don Fadrique”[776].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (3 Aug 1364) as his first wife, JUAN de Aragón Conde de Ampurias, son of Infante don RAMÓN BERENGUER de Aragón Conde de Ampurias & his second wife María Álvarez de Ejérica (1338-Castellví de Rosanes 1398).
