2 CONT i)          CHARLES MARTEL di Calabria (posthumously Naples 25 Dec 1345-Visegrad 1348, after 10 May, bur Székesfehérvár, church of Notre Dame).  Duke of Calabria.  Principe di Salerno 11 Dec 1346, as heir to the kingdom of Sicily.
2 CONC   On the murder of his future father-in-law by his uncle Lajos King of Hungary, the latter had Charles Martel sent to Visegrad in Hungary.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Betrothed''' to (1347) JEANNE di Durazzo, daughter of CHARLES di Durazzo Duca di Durazzo & his wife Marie of Sicily (1344-poisoned château d'Œuf, Naples 20 Jul 1387, bur Naples, church of San Lorenzo).  
