2 CONT *'''Elector of Brandenburg:''' Reign 1351–1365
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Ludwig-V-Louis-von-Bayern/6000000002322312706 Louis the Brandenburger] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Otto-V-von-Bayern/6000000002188383187 Otto the Bavarian]
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Duke of Bavaria:''' Reign 1347–1365
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Louis-IV-Holy-Roman-Emperor/4202780705000039134 Louis IV] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Stephan-II-Herzog-von-Bayern-Ingolstadt/6000000006727832747 Stephen II]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludwig VI Kurfürst von Brandenburg was born in 1330. He was the son of Ludwig IV von Bayern, Holy Roman Emperor. He married Kunigarde of Poland, daughter of Casimir III, King of Poland and Anne of Lithuania, in 1345. He died in 13
2 CONC 65.
2 CONT      He was a member of the House of Wittelsbach. He gained the title of Kurfürst von Brandenburg. He succeeded as the Herzog (Duke) von Bayern in 1347.
