2 CONC annes exiled "Nicephorum Bestin eius filium" to "Imbrun"[1373].  Zonaras records that "Leo cum altero filio Nicephoro" left Lesbos for Thrace but were captured and blinded on the orders of Emperor Ioannes[1374]. 
