2 CONT One Ügyek; m.Emese, dau.of Pr Önedbelia of Dentümoger; they had a son:  Álmos, *820, +Transylvania ca 895, had a son: Árpád, Prince of Hungary, +907; he settled in what is now Hungary in about 900, though they continued to ravage 
2 CONC western Europe til their defeat by Emperor Otto I in 955. He had issue: 
2 CONT * ...
