1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_Asenina_of_Bulgaria
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Asenina of Bulgaria was a Bulgarian princess and empress. She was the consort of Emperor Mitso Asen of Bulgaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Emperor Ivan Asen II of Bulgaria and Empress Irene Komnene of Epirus. Through her mother, she was a granddaughter of Theodore of Epirus. She is mother of Bulgarian Emperor Ivan Asen III and of Bulgarian Emp
2 CONC ress Kira Maria, who married Emperor George I of Bulgaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Asenina of Bulgaria Asen dynasty Born: 1238?–1241? Died:  ? Empress consort of Bulgaria 1256–1257
2 CONT
