1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Overview=
2 CONT * Marquis de Montferrat (1494-1518) :
2 CONT ** preceded by [http://www.geni.com/people/Bonifacio-III-Paleologo/377260401250012347 Boniface III]
2 CONT ** succeeded by [http://www.geni.com/people/Boniface-of-Montferrat/6000000013299588083 Boniface IV]
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT * [http://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000027609064898 Moreri, L., ''Le Grand Dictionnaire Historique -- Les Montferrat'', 1759] (ci-joint)
