2 CONT * [http://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guglielmo_IX_del_Monferrato Guglielmo IX del Monferrato, Wikipédia]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===================
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne of Alençon
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT She was betrothed to William IX, Marquis of Montferrat in 1501 and married him on 31 October 1508, the day after her sixteenth birthday, in the church of St. Sauveur in Blois. She bore her husband three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria (1509–1530),
2 CONT
2 CONT Margherita, (1510-1566),
2 CONT
2 CONT Boniface (1512-1530), William's heir who became Boniface IV of Montferrat.
