2 CONT *'''Count of Holstein-Rendsburg (as Henry II):''' Reign 1340-1381/1384 with his brother [http://www.geni.com/people/Nikolaus-von-Holstein-Schauenburg/6000000006727838531 Nicholas] (1340-1397)
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Gerhard-III-von-Holstein/6000000004533205532 Gerhard III] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Nikolaus-von-Holstein-Schauenburg/6000000006727838531 Nicholas], [http://www.ge
2 CONC ni.com/people/Albrecht-Holstein/6000000001009256826 Albert II] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Gerhard-VI-von-Holstein-Herzog-von-Schleswig-Holstein/4079111 Gerhard VI]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Duke of Schleswig: (as Henry II):''' 1375-1381/1384 with his brother [http://www.geni.com/people/Nikolaus-von-Holstein-Schauenburg/6000000006727838531 Nicholas] (1375-1386)
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Heinrich-Valdemarsen/6000000003391027939 Henry I] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Nikolaus-von-Holstein-Schauenburg/6000000006727838531 Nicholas]
