2 CONC r Schleswig-Holstein History, Neumünster: Wachholtz, 2008, pp. 373–389, here p. 377. ISBN  978-3-529-02606-5
2 CONT * Elke Freifrau von Boeselager, "The land of Hadeln until the beginning of the early modern times", In: History of the country between Elbe and Weser : 3 vols., Hans-Eckhard Dannenberg and Heinz-Joachim Schulze (eds.) On behalf of
