2 CONT
2 CONT i)     '''     GUILLAUME PIERRE [III] Lascaris ''' (-[8 Apr 1358/1363]).  Père Anselme records his parentage[893].  “Guilielmus Petrus Lascar comes Vintimilii et generalis dominus Rochabrunæ” swore allegiance to Jeanne Queen of Si
2 CONC cily by charter dated 7 Dec 1352[894].  “Dominus Petrus Lascharis...comes Ventimilii” sold “castrum villam seu terram Rochebrune...in dyocessi civitatis Ventimilii” to “domini Caroli de Grimaldis militis” by charter dated 2 Jan 13
2 CONC 55[895].  The testament of “Guglielmo Pietro Lascaris de’ Conti di Ventimiglia, Signore di Tenda, Briga, Limone,Vernante, Roccabruna”, dated 8 Apr 1358, chose burial at Tende Sainte-Marie, bequeathed property to “Giovanna moglie d
2 CONC i Pedrino Alfonso de’ Conti di Ventimiglia, Vataccia moglie di Manuele de’ Faletti, Salvaga maritata ad Opicino, Alisenda a Giorgino Alasi de Cuneo, Violante e Leonora ancora nubili, sue figli” and named as joint universal heirs “
2 CONC Antonio, Giovannino, Guglielmo Pietro, Pietro Balbo e Lodovico suoi figli”[896].  Gioffredo records that his sons succeeded Guillaume Pierre [III], in accordance with the previous testament, in 1363[897].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---.  The primary source which confirms the name of Guillaume Pierre’s wife has not been identified.  
2 CONT
