1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CATALAN%20NOBILITY.htm#UrracaEntenzadiedafter1332
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         '''URRACA de Entenza''' (-before 15 May 1338).  The testament of "don Gombalt d´Entenca senyor d´Alcolea", dated 12 Sep 1304, bequeathes property to "…Hurraqua d´Entiença filia mía", and appoints "Tharesa d´Entiença fil
2 CONC la mía e de dona Gostança d´Antillyon muller mía" as his heir, and his daughter Urraca in default "no haviendo otros fillos de la dita muller mía"[2544].  The testament of "Infantissa Theresia…domini infantis Alfonsi consors ac co
2 CONC mitissa Urgelli", dated 23 Oct 1327, bequeathes property to "…Urache d´Entiença sorori nostre…Castellane uxor quondam Emanuelis de Entiença de domo nostra…Sanccie Roderici de domo nostra…Mayllete d´Entiença…Teresie filie Emanuelis
2 CONC  d´Entiença…domicellabus nostris…Teresie Gombaldi sorori nostre moniali monasterii de Casvis…Poncio Ugonis fratri nostro naturali…Guillelmi d´Entiença fratri nostro naturali…Iohanni Martini d´Entiença…"[2545].  Santiago records th
2 CONC at “Urraca de Entenza” married “Bernardo Roger conde de Pallás, hijo del conde Hugo de Mataplana”, but died without heirs, but does not cite the corresponding primary source[2546].  Pedro IV King of Aragon notified “domine Constan
2 CONC cie...Maioricharum regine, sorori nostre” of the death of “nobilis Urracha d’Entença, amitta comuni nostra” by charter dated 15 May 1338[2547].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ARNAU ROGER [II] Conde de Pallars, son of UGO [VI] de Mataplana Barón de Mataplana & his wife Sibila Condesa de Pallars-Subirà. 
