2 CONT
2 CONT Anne of Bohemia (May 11, 1366 – June 7, 1394), also known as Good Queen Anne, was a daughter of Charles IV, Holy Roman Emperor, King of Bohemia and Elizabeth of Pomerania. She was a member of the House of Luxembourg and was the fi
2 CONC rst Queen consort of Richard II of England.
2 CONT
