2 CONC  of Hungary and Croatia (with Mary)  Reign 1387–1437  Coronation 31 March 1387 in Székesfehérvár  Predecessor Mary  Successor Albert  King of Bohemia  Reign 1419–1437  Coronation 27 July 1420 in Prague  Predecessor Wenceslaus IV  
