1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jan (Iwaszko) Moniwidowicz''' (samogitian: Jonas Manwydas) of the Leliwa coat of arms (born around 1395 - died 1458), Lithuanian boyar, starosta (elder, ruler) of Podolia and Krzemieniec 1437/1438, state marshal
2 CONC  in 1438, voivode (general governor) of Trakai (1443- 1458), Vilnius voivode in 1458.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Moniwid, Vilnius voivode and princess Julianna of Smolensk. Initially, a supporter of Švitrigaila, from 1440 he supported the assumption of the grand-ducal throne by the Polish king. He led a party in Lithuania t
2 CONC hat defended the rights of the Grand Duchy of Lithuania, but he avoided conflicts with the king and Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bibliography'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Polish Biographical Dictionary, vol. XXI, pp. 660-661.
2 CONT * Władysław Semkowicz. About the Lithuanian boyar families united with the Polish nobility in Horodło, 1413. [in:] The Heraldyczny monthly. Organ of the Heraldic Society in Lviv. R.6 1913 no.11-12 (House Moniwida)
2 CONT * Semkowicz W. On Lithuanian boyar families united with the Polish nobility in Horodło, 1413. Heraldyczny monthly. Organ of the Heraldic Society in Lviv. R.6 1913 no.11-12 (House Moniwida) [Semkowicz W. O litewskich rodach bojarsk
2 CONC ich zbratanych ze szlachtą polską w Horodle r.1413. Miesięcznik Heraldyczny. Organ Towarzystwa Heraldycznego we Lwowie. R.6 1913 nr11-12 (Ród Moniwida)] 
2 CONT * Officials of the Grand Duchy of Lithuania, T. I, Vilnius Voivodeship, 14th-18th century, edited by A. Rachuba, Warsaw 2004, p. 693.
