1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sigismund son of Karybut was brought up at the royal court of his uncle Jagiello. Sigismund participated in the battle of Grunewald. Subsequently, he proved himself as a commander, participated in the Hussite Wars,
2 CONC  was the viceroy of the Czech kingdom.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1431, Sigismund, elected by the Hussites to the Bohemian throne.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in the battle of Vilkomir in 1435.
