2 CONC n/6000000055825025464 Thadeé (Thadée) Valenza de Visconti], daughter of Stefano di Visconti, Barnabé's father), who married a certain Jean de Vathon (the ELDER). In fact, Jean de Vauthon the elder had a son also named Jean de Vaut
