1 OCCU Reine de France - Fille d'Etienne III duc de Baviáere-Ingolstadt, Queen, aka Isabella, Queen of France/Princess of Bavaria, Princess of Bavaria, Queen of France, Isabeau of Bavaria, Isabeau de Bavière, Ισαβέλλα της Βαυαρίας, Reine
