1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John II, Duke of Bavaria
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage and children
2 CONT
2 CONT He married in 1372 Katharina of Görz, a daughter of Count Meinhard VI of Görz and Catharina of Pfannberg; Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernest I of Bavaria-Munich (1373–2 July 1438, Munich).
2 CONT
2 CONT William III of Bavaria-Munich (1375, Munich–1435, Munich).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sofia of Bavaria (1376–26 September 1425, Pressburg), married in Prague 2 May 1389 King Wenceslaus.
2 CONT
2 CONT He also had an illegitimate son, Johann Grünwalder (1393–1452), who was Cardinal and Bishop of Freising.
