2 CONC ([954]-after 988). ... m secondly ([985]) as her second husband, ADELAJDA [Adleta] of Poland, widow of his brother MIHÁLY of Hungary Duke between March and Gran, daughter of [ZIEMOMYSŁ Duke in Poland] & his [second wife ---] ([950
2 CONC /60]-after 997). ... Prince Géza & his first wife had [three] children: 
