2 CONT ===Family===
2 CONT #Tihomir († 1169), oldest son, ruled as Grand župan of Raška (1163.-(1166) 1168).
2 CONT #Stracimir († after 1189), ruled the region of Western Morava (1163-(1166) 1168, 1169-?).
2 CONT #Miroslav († 1196 or 1199), ruled Zahumlje (1163-(1166) 1168, and 1169 to his death).
2 CONT #Nemanja (born 1113 - † 1199), youngest son, ruled as Grand župan of Raška ((1166) 1168 - 25.03. 1196).
2 CONT #Daughter(s), (as Nemanja and his brothers are registered as maternal uncles of Mihailo III of Duklja)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nemanji%C4%87_family_tree
2 CONT
2 CONT Nemanjić family tree
2 CONT
2 CONT Vukan / Stefan Vukan / Uroš I 
2 CONT * Zavida, Prince of Zachumlia before 1145 
2 CONT ** Tihomir, Grand Prince of Serbia 1163-1166
2 CONT ** Stracimir, Prince of West Morava 1163-after 1180s
2 CONT ** Miroslav, Prince of Hum 1163–1190 
2 CONT *** ... 
