2 CONT *'''     Felipe de Castilla was the son''' of Fernando III, Rey de Castilla y León and Elisabeth von Hohenstaufen.1,2 '''He married, firstly, Christine Haakonsdottir, Princess of Norway''', daughter of Haakon IV Haakonsson, King o
2 CONC f Norway and Margareta Skulesdotter, '''in 1258.1 He married, secondly, Leonor Ruiz de Castro between 1262 and 1269.2 He died in 1274.
2 CONT *'''     He held the office of Archbishop of Seville.
