2 CONT ==Amadeo VIII Duca di Savoia1 
2 CONT '''M, #170087, b. 4 September 1383, d. 7 January 1451'''
2 CONT Last Edited=2 Jul 2020
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=1.78%
2 CONT '''Amadeo VIII Duca di Savoia was born on 4 September 1383 at Chambéry, France.2,3 He was the son''' of Amadeo VII Conte di Savoia and Bonne de Berry, Vicomtesse de Carlat et de Murat.1,2 '''He married Marie de Valois-Bourgogne'''
2 CONC , daughter of Philippe II de Valois, Duc de Bourgogne and Marguerite de Flandre, Comtesse de Flandre, '''on 30 October 1401 at Arras, FranceG.2,3 He died on 7 January 1451 at age 67.'''1,3
2 CONT '''He succeeded as the Conte di Savoia in 1391.1 He was created Duca di Savoia in 1416.1 He took the religious name of Antipope Felix V between 1439 and 1449.1 He abdicated as Duke of Savoy in 1440.'''1
2 CONT '''Children of Amadeo VIII Duca di Savoia and Marie de Valois-Bourgogne'''
2 CONT 1. Margaret di Savoia2 b. 1405, d. 1418
2 CONT 2. Anthony di Savoia2 b. 1407
2 CONT 3. Anthony di Savoia2 b. 1408
2 CONT 4. Marie di Savoia2 b. 1411, d. 1469
2 CONT 5. Amadeus di Savoia, Prince of Piedmonte2 b. 1412, d. 1431
