2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         DEMETRIOS .  The Masarelli Vatican manuscript names (in order) Demetrios, Manuel, Georgios, Andronikos, Thomas, as the sons of Theodoros & his wife, commenting that Demetrios died as a young man[578].  He died as a youn
2 CONC g man.  
2 CONT
