1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conrad_I,_Count_of_Oldenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00023767&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT  Konrad I Count Of OLDENBURG     
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad I Count Of was born about 1300 in Of, Oldenburg, Oldenburg, Germany.  Konrad I Count Of's father is Johann II Count Of OLDENBURG and his mother is Hedwig Countess Of DIEPHOLZ.  His paternal grandfather was Christian III Or 
2 CONC V Count Of OLDENBURG and his paternal grandmother is Hedwig Countess Of OLDENBURG-WILDESHAUSEN; his maternal grandparents are Konrad von DIEPHOLZ and Hedwig Countess of RIETBERG. He had a brother and a sister, named Moritz Count O
2 CONC f and Gisela Countess Of.  He was the oldest of the three children.  He died in 1347.
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad I Count Of OLDENBURG & Ingeburg Countess Of HOLSTEIN   
2 CONT
2 CONT They were partners, the type of relationship is unspecified.  They had three sons and three daughters, named Konrad II Count Of, Gerhard Count Of, Christian V Count Of, Agnes Countess Of, Ingeburg Countess Of and Anastasia Countes
2 CONC s Of.
2 CONT
2 CONT Personal Details
2 CONT
2 CONT  Konrad I Count Of OLDENBURG
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad I Count Of was born about 1300 in Of, Oldenburg, Oldenburg, Germany.  He died in 1347.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Ingeburg Countess Of HOLSTEIN
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeburg Countess Of was born about 1316 in Of, , Oldenburg, Germany.  She died before 1340.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT   Konrad II Count Of OLDENBURG
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad II Count Of was born about 1331 in Of, Oldenburg, Oldenburg, Germany.  He died after 1401.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Gerhard Count Of OLDENBURG
2 CONT
2 CONT Gerhard Count Of was born about 1332 in Of, Oldenburg, Oldenburg, Germany.  He died in 1368.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Agnes Countess Of OLDENBURG
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Countess Of was born about 1333 in Of, Oldenburg, Oldenburg, Germany.  She died after 1399.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Christian V Count Of OLDENBURG
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian V Count Of was born about 1340 in Of, Oldenburg, Oldenburg, Germany.  He died after 1399.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Ingeburg Countess Of OLDENBURG
2 CONT
2 CONT   Anastasia Countess Of OLDENBURG
