1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =SOPHIE von Holstein=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter  of HEINRICH II "dem Eisernen" Graf von Holstein-Rendsburg & his second wife Ingeburg von Mecklenburg (-after 1451).
2 CONT * Birth:	circa 1373 in Itzehoe, Holstein, Deutschland (HRR)
2 CONT * Death:	1451 (74-82) Wroclaw, Böhmen, Deutschland(HRR)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/POMERANIA.htm#Adelheiddiedafter1445 Project MedLands POMERANIA]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: BOGISLAW von Pommern ([1363/68]-11 Feb 1418).  He succeeded his half-brother in 1377 as BOGISLAW VIII of Pomerania in Hinterpommern.  m ([1398]) SOPHIE von Holstein, daughter of HEINRICH II "dem Eisernen" Graf von Holst
2 CONC ein-Rendsburg & his second wife Ingeburg von Mecklenburg (-after 1451).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Bogislaw VIII & his wife SOPHIE had three children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''1)          INGEBORG''' (-before 16 Jun 1450).  m ([1425/28]) as his second wife, HEINRICH Herzog von Mecklenburg-Stargard, son of ULRICH I Herzog von Mecklenburg-Stargard & his second wife Margarete von Pommern (-[26 May/20 
2 CONC Aug] 1466, bur Wanzka).
2 CONT * '''2)         BOGISLAW von Pommern''' 1407/10]-7 Dec 1446).  He succeeded his father in 1418 as BOGISLAW IX Duke of Pomerania in Stargard.  m (24 Jun 1432) MARIA of Mazovia, daughter of SIEMOWIT IV Duke of Mazovia [Piast] & his 
2 CONC wife Aleksandra of Lithuania ([1410-18 Feb 1454).  
2 CONT *''' 3)        ADELHEID von Pommern''' 1410-after 1445).  m (2 Feb 1429) BERNHARD II Herzog von Sachsen-Lauenburg ([1385-16 Jul 1463)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Son Bogislaw IX & his wife MARIA had two children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''(a)       SOPHIE''' ([1435]-[24 Aug 1494/1497]).  m (1451 after Feb) as his second wife, ERICH II Duke of Pomerania in Wolgast, son of WARTISLAW IX Duke of Pomerania & his wife Sophie von Sachsen-Lauenburg ([1418/25]-Wolgast 5 
2 CONC Jul 1474). 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''(b)       ALEXANDRA'' ('1451). 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sofia_av_Holstein
2 CONT * http://finnholbek.dk/getperson.php?personID=I5094&tree=2
2 CONT * http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/POMERANIA.htm#Adelheiddiedafter1445
