2 CONT e)         '''ALBRECHT''' (-[1365]).  Landeshauptmann in Friulia, Görz and Istria 1329 to 1338.  He succeeded his cousin in 1338 as ALBRECHT III Graf von Görz.  Pfalzgraf von Kärnten 1339.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly HELENA, daughter of --- .  1342.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly ([1353]) as her first husband, KATHARINA of Celje, daughter of FREDERIC [I] Count of Celje [Cilli] & his wife Diemut von Wallsee (-17 Jul 1389).  
2 CONT She married secondly (before 22 Jul 1367) as his second wife, Johann [II] Truchseß von Waldburg. 
