2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland
2 CONT '''A contract for the marriage of Elisabeth von Ziegenhain and Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg was signed on 3 April 1379.2 Elisabeth von Ziegenhain married Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg''', son of Ulric IV, Count von Ha
2 CONC nau-Munzenberg and Elisabeth von Wertheim, '''circa 19 February 1394.5,3 Elisabeth von Ziegenhain died on 1 December 1431.'''2,3
2 CONT '''Family	Ulric V, Count von Hanau-Munzenberg''' b. 1368, d. a 27 Oct 1416
