2 CONT ___________________________
2 CONT ==Elisabeth von Ziegenhain1 
2 CONT '''F, #649040, d. 1 December 1431'''
2 CONT Last Edited=28 Oct 2014
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.51%
2 CONT '''Elisabeth von Ziegenhain was the daughter''' of Gottfried VIII Graf von Ziegenhain Graf von Nidda and Agnes Prinzessin von Braunschweig-Göttingen.1 '''She married Ulrich V Graf von Hanau in 1379.1 She died on 1 December 1431.''
2 CONC '1
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1. [S3268] Hans Harmsen, "re: Chester Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 21 August 2008. Hereinafter cited as "re: Chester Family."
2 CONT From: https://www.thepeerage.com/p64904.htm#i649040
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________________
2 CONT ==Elisabeth von Ziegenhain
2 CONT '''Birth	1375'''
2 CONT '''Death	1 Dec 1431 (aged 55–56)'''
2 CONT '''Burial	Kloster Klarenthal'''
2 CONT '''Wiesbaden, Stadtkreis Wiesbaden, Hessen, Germany'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 158575575
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT '''Parents'''
