1 NOTE Duke Albert III of Austria succeeded his brother, Rudolf IV as Sovereign of the Empire of Austria in 1358.  Albert III divided Austria with his brother, Leopold, and founded the House of Albert. He ruled until 1397, and was succee
2 CONC ded by his son Albert IV.
