1 OCCU ruler of Epirus from 1429 until his death in 1448
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carlo_II_Tocco
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LATIN%20LORDSHIPS%20IN%20GREECE.htm#CarloIIToccodied1448B
2 CONT
2 CONT CARLO [II] Tocco, son of LEONARDO Tocco Lord of Zante & his wife --- (-30 Sep 1448).  Spandounes records that "Carlo Tocco" adopted "il conte Leonardo suo fratello…figliolo legitimo…Carlo" as his heir[681].  He was the adopted son
2 CONC  of his uncle Carlo I Count of Kefalonia.  Count of Zante 1424.  He succeeded his uncle in 1429 as despot in Epirus.  The Ottomans captured Janina 9 Oct 1430 after being asked to intervene by Carlo's cousin Memnon, but Carlo was p
2 CONC ermitted to continue ruling in the rest of Epirus.  He styled himself "Lord of Arta".  Carlo appealed for Venetian protection, and was made a Venetian citizen and elected to the Grand Council[682].  In 1444, Carlo repudiated Turki
2 CONC sh suzerainty but was captured by the Turks and forced back to vassalage[683]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' RAIMONDINA di Ventimiglia, daughter of GIOVANNI di Ventimiglia e Aragona Marchese di Gerace [Viceroy of Naples and Sicily] & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Carlo & his wife had four children:  
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT Zante bárója (Conte di Zante)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
