2 CONT 5.3.5 .--Guillem Ramon de Borja and Sanoguera. He was in Rome at the service of Pope Alexander VI, died in 1503. He left in Rome two natural children, and Valencia one legitimate daughter, taking his wife Violant Castellverde SANC
