2 CONC ne, 85 vols., (Paris: L.G. Michaud, 1813), 8:114 sub Charles VI. Jump up ^ M. Guizot, The History of France from the Earliest Times to the Year 1789, Vol. 2, transl. Robert Black, (P.F. Collier & son, 1902), 189. Jump up ^ R.C. Fa
