2 CONT
2 CONT King Charles V & his wife had nine children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. MARIE de France (Hôtel de Saint-Pol, Paris 27 Feb 1370-Paris Jun 1377).  Betrothed (1373) to GUILLAUME de Hainaut, WILHELM von Bayern-Straubing, son of ALBRECHT Duke of Bavaria-Straubing [later ALBERT Comte de Hainaut, Count of
2 CONC  Holland] & his first wife Margareta von Brieg [Piast] (5 Apr 1365-château de Bouchain 30 May 1417, bur Valenciennes).  He succeeded his father in 1404 as GUILLAUME VI Comte de Hainaut, WILLEM V Count of Holland, WILHELM II Graf v
2 CONC on Straubing. 
