2 CONT '''Marie de Berry'''
2 CONT '''Birth	1375'''
2 CONT '''Death	Jun 1434 (aged 58–59)'''
2 CONT '''Burial	Abbaye de Souvigny'''
2 CONT '''Souvigny, Departement de l'Allier, Auvergne, France'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 65703255
2 CONT '''Royalty. Born the daughter''' of Jean de Valois, Duc de Berry and his wife Jeanne d'Armagnac. '''She was married first to Louis de Blois-Châtillon who died in 1391 after five years of marriage. Six months later she married Phil
2 CONC ippe de Artois, Count of Eu whom she bore four children. Thirdly she married Jean de Bourbon. During Jeans imprisonment she administered his estates.'''
