2 CONC d Limburg, Markgravine of Antwerp, Dame de Malines 1404.  m firstly (Papal dispensation 31 Jan 1356, contract Paris 21 Mar 1357, Arras, église Saint-Vaast 14 May 1357, not consummated) [https://www.geni.com/people/Philippe-de-Rouv
