0 @N6000000002322298554@ NOTE He was the last of the German Hohenstaufen dynasty as claimant to the throne
1 CONT of Sicily. As leading hope of the antipapal Italian Ghibellines, he led an
1 CONT expedition into Italy (1267) in an unsuccessful attempt to regain Sicily from
1 CONT Charles of Anjou (France). After claiming inheritance of the kingdom of
