1 CONT [edit] Family and children
1 CONT On July 28, 1332, at the age of 13, John was married to Bonne of Bohemia (d. 1349), daughter of John I (the Blind) of Bohemia. Their children were:
1 CONT
1 CONT Charles V (January 21, 1338–September 16, 1380) 
1 CONT Louis I, Duke of Anjou (July 23, 1339–September 20, 1384) 
1 CONT John, Duke of Berry (November 30, 1340–June 15, 1416) 
1 CONT Philippe II, Duke of Burgundy (January 17, 1342 – April 27, 1404) 
1 CONT Jeanne (June 24, 1343 – November 3, 1373), married Charles II (the Bad) of Navarre 
1 CONT Marie (September 12, 1344–October 1404), married Robert I, Duke of Bar 
1 CONT Agnès (1345–1349) 
1 CONT Marguerite (1347–1352) 
1 CONT Isabelle (October 1, 1348–September 11, 1372), married Gian Galeazzo I, Duke of Milan 
