1 CONT On February 19, 1349 (old style), at Nanterre, he married Joanna I of Auvergne (d. 1361), Countess of Auvergne and Boulogne. She was widow of Philip of Burgundy, the deceased heir of that duchy, and mother of the young Philip I, D
1 CONC uke of Burgundy (1344-61) who became John's stepson and ward. John and Joanna had two daughters, both of whom died young:
1 CONT
