0 @N6000000001563284692@ NOTE Being a fierce opponent to the Roman Catholic Pope, he opened the last medieval battle between emperorship and popehood.  Despite being excommunicated by Pope John XXII,  he became Roman Emperor of the German Reich in 1328.
1 CONT
1 CONT He set out to aggrandize his branch of the family.  He invested his eldest son with the Margravate of Brandenburg when the Ascanian house became extinct.  He saw to it that the sons by his 2nd marriage (to Margaret of Holland) suc
1 CONC ceeded to the country of Holland.  However, when Ludwig died his sons began a process of dividing Bavaria into individual fiefs. This continued until it was pretty much reunited in 1506.
