1 CONC  over possessions in Lower Bavaria. The war against his brother Rudolf due to new disputes on the partition of their lands was ended in 1313, when peace was made at Munich.
1 CONT
1 CONT After the death of Holy Roman Emperor Henry VII the Luxemburg party among the prince electors set aside Henry's son, John of Luxembourg, because of his youth and chose Louis as rival king to the Habsburg Frederick the Handsome in 
1 CONC 1314. Short before this election Louis had defeated his cousin Frederick in the battle of Gammelsdorf. In 1316 Louis reckognized the independence of Switzerland from Habsburg. In the battle of Mühldorf 1322 Frederick was beaten ag
1 CONC ain and arrested but soon released and accepted as co-regent until he died in 1330.
