1 CONT Stephen Ladislaus I (Stefan Vladislav I, ?????? ????????? I) (died after 1264) was Serb king from 1233 up to 1242, son of Stefan Prvovencani and Eudocia Angelina, and son-in-law of Bulgarian tzar Ivan Asen II. He overthrew his old
1 CONC er brother, king Radoslav and succeeded with help from his father-in-law. He transferred body of Saint Sava from Trnovo to Mileševa. After death of his father-in-law, during Tatar invasion in Middle Europe he was overthrown by his
1 CONC  younger brother Uroš, who gave him to rule Zeta.
1 CONT
1 CONT His marriage with Beloslava, daughter of Ivan Asen II issued two children:
1 CONT
1 CONT Desa 
1 CONT anonymous daughter, who married a Balkan nobleman. 
