0 @N6000000002187788030@ NOTE Christian V, Count of Oldenburg
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Count Christian V of Oldenburg, (d. 1423), was the father of Count Dietrich of Oldenburg, and is an ancestor to the British royalty. He was made a Count in 1398, and retained that position until his death 1423, Christian was marri
1 CONC ed to Agnes of Honstein. He was born sometime before 1347 to Count Conrad I of Oldenburg and Ingeborg von Braunschweig. He is the 16th great-grandfather of Prince William of Wales, 15th great-grandfather of Prince Charles, Prince 
1 CONC of Wales, and 14th great-grandfather of Prince Philip Mountbatten, Duke of Edinburgh.
