0 @N6000000007329549675@ NOTE [Kopi av ROYALS.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Reign: 1377-1399;  Richard is perhaps England's most tragic king.  His reign
1 CONT began with great promise but after he attained his majority it proceeded from
1 CONT failure to failure, not always of his making.  He was only 33 when he died.
